        <section class="game-intro">
            <h2>The Race to the Top</h2>
            <p>Uma Musume: Pretty Derby is a multimedia franchise where famous Japanese racehorses are reimagined as "Horse Girls." Players take on the role of a trainer to help these girls win the prestigious Twinkle Series and perform in Winning Live concerts. It combines deep training simulation mechanics with emotional storytelling and high-energy racing action.</p>
        </section>

        <section>
            <h2>Why I Play</h2>
            <p>The character designs are incredible, and the game does a fantastic job of honoring the real-life history of the horses they are based on. Watching your favorite Horse Girl finally win a G1 race after weeks of training is incredibly rewarding. The production value of the 3D race sequences and live performances is top-tier for a mobile game.</p>
            
            <ul class="stats-list">
                <li>Deep training simulation mechanics</li>
                <li>High-quality 3D racing animations</li>
                <li>Emotional character-driven stories</li>
                <li>Exciting "Winning Live" idol performances</li>
                <li>Historical tributes to real racehorses</li>
                <li>Vibrant and competitive community</li>
            </ul>
        </section>
